  "details": "This has happened alot with friends who have their status set to the blue 'Join Me' status in their own private worlds and most of the time the 'automatic invite' part of that status doesn't work for me. I send them invite requests, I even turn the HUD off and then on and restart Vrchat multiple times and each time i never receive the accepted invite to join them in their worlds. This is incredibly frustrating when trying to join on friends and being unable to unless they manually see the invites come in since it seems the automatic acceptance of invites either doesn't work or sends the accepted invite somewhere that isn't myself.",
